cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Brassica rapa — Radiation-Induced Change in Floral Scent (LLGCSS)"
abstract: >-
  RNA-seq analysis code and data for a Brassica rapa (Wisconsin Fast Plant)
  project investigating whether galactic cosmic ray (GCR) radiation alters
  floral scent, combining a High/Low floral-scent transcriptome with a
  0/40 cGy radiation dose-response transcriptome. Part of the Lunar LEAF effort.
type: software
